      "text": "BREAKING:  Weather Update\nTyphoon Uwan is expected to cause widespread heavy rains and strong winds across the Philippines, impacting regions from Northern Luzon (Region I) to Central Luzon, Metro Manila, Southern Luzon , Bicol Region, as well as Western, Eastern, and Central Visayas ( Cebu ) , and the Caraga Region in Mindanao, posing serious risks of flooding, landslides, and storm surges throughout the affected areas.\n\ningat po sa lahat\n#UwanPH",
